# SGWA Application Flow Diagrams

## 1. High-Level System Architecture

```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph "Public Realm"
        Public[Public User] --> Landing[Public Landing Page]
        Landing --> KnowEC[Know Your EC]
        Landing --> AppStatus[Track Status]
        Landing --> Login[Login / Register]
    end

    subgraph "Applicant Portal (NOC)"
        Login --> Dashboard[Applicant Dashboard]
        Dashboard --> NewApp[New NOC Application]
        Dashboard --> Profile[Company/User Profile]
        Dashboard --> MyApps[My Applications]
        Dashboard --> Pay[Payments]
        Dashboard --> Compliance[Self Compliance]
        
        NewApp --> Form[Application Form]
        Form --> Uploads[Document Uploads]
        Uploads --> FeePay[Fee Payment]
        FeePay --> Submit[Submit Application]
    end

    subgraph "Officer Portal"
        OfficerLogin[Officer Login]
        
        subgraph "DGO (District)"
            OfficerLogin --> DGODash[DGO Dashboard]
            DGODash --> DGOList[Application List]
            DGOList --> DGOReview[Review Application]
            DGOReview --> InspAssign[Assign Inspector]
            InspAssign --> InspReport[Inspection Report]
            InspReport --> DGORec[Recommendation]
        end

        subgraph "SGWA (State Authority)"
            OfficerLogin --> SGWADash[SGWA Dashboard]
            DGORec --> SGWAList[Pending SGWA Approval]
            SGWAList --> SGWAReview[Final Review]
            SGWAReview --> TechReview[Technical Review]
            TechReview --> SGWADecision{Decision}
            SGWADecision -->|Approve| IssueNOC[Issue NOC]
            SGWADecision -->|Reject| IssueReject[Issue Rejection]
            SGWADecision -->|Query| RaiseQuery[Raise Query]
        end

        subgraph "Enforcement Wing"
            OfficerLogin --> EnfDash[Enforcement Dashboard]
            IssueNOC --> ActiveNOCs[Monitor Active NOCs]
            ActiveNOCs --> ScheduleInsp[Schedule Inspection]
            ScheduleInsp --> FieldInsp[Field Inspection]
            FieldInsp --> ViolationCheck{Violation?}
            ViolationCheck -->|Yes| Penalty[Issue Penalty/Warning]
            ViolationCheck -->|No| Safe[Compliant]
        end
    end

    Submit --> DGOList
    RaiseQuery --> MyApps
    IssueNOC --> MyApps
    IssueReject --> MyApps
```

## 2. Detailed NOC Application Workflow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Applicant
    participant Sys as System
    participant DGO as DGO Officer
    participant Insp as Inspector
    participant SGWA as SGWA Authority

    App->>Sys: Register & Login
    App->>Sys: Fill Application (Profile, Land, Water)
    App->>Sys: Upload Documents
    App->>Sys: Pay Processing Fees
    App->>Sys: Submit Application

    Sys->>DGO: Assign to District DGO
    
    DGO->>DGO: Review Application & Docs
    alt Docs Incomplete
        DGO->>App: Raise Query (Ask for Docs)
        App->>DGO: Resubmit Docs
    end

    DGO->>Insp: Schedule Site Inspection
    Insp->>App: Visit Site & Verify
    Insp->>DGO: Submit Inspection Report

    DGO->>SGWA: Forward with Recommendation (Approve/Reject)

    SGWA->>SGWA: Review Application + DGO Report
    opt Technical Review
        SGWA->>SGWA: Internal Tech Review
    end

    alt Query Needed
        SGWA->>App: Raise Query
        App->>SGWA: Respond to Query
    end

    alt Approve
        SGWA->>App: Issue NOC (Digital Certificate)
        Sys->>App: Notify & Update Status
    else Reject
        SGWA->>App: Issue Rejection Letter
        Sys->>App: Notify & Update Status
    end
```

## 3. Enforcement & Compliance Workflow

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ActiveNOC
    ActiveNOC --> Monitoring : System Checks
    Monitoring --> Compliant : Data OK
    Monitoring --> Flagged : Anomaly Detected
    
    ActiveNOC --> ScheduledInspection : Routine/Complaint
    
    ScheduledInspection --> FieldVisit
    FieldVisit --> InspectionReport
    
    state InspectionReport {
        [*] --> CheckMeter
        CheckMeter --> CheckDocs
        CheckDocs --> CheckExtraction
    }

    InspectionReport --> ViolationAssessment
    
    state ViolationAssessment {
        [*] --> NoViolation
        [*] --> MinorViolation
        [*] --> MajorViolation
    }

    NoViolation --> Compliant
    MinorViolation --> Warning : First Offense
    Warning --> Rectified : Compliance Report
    Warning --> MajorViolation : Repeated
    
    MajorViolation --> Penalty : Issue Challan
    Penalty --> PenaltyPaid : Payment Received
    Penalty --> Cancellation : Non-Payment
    
    MajorViolation --> Cancellation : Critical Violation
    Cancellation --> [*]
```

## 4. Key Modules & Features

### NOC Module
- **Registration**: OTP-based, Profile Creation.
- **Application**: Step-by-step form (General, Land Details, Water Requirement, Documents).
- **Calculators**: Water Budget, Abstraction Charges.
- **Payment**: Integrated Gateway for Fees.
- **Self Compliance**: Post-NOC reporting.

### Officer Module
- **Dashboard**: Role-based stats (DGO/SGWA/Enforcement).
- **Application Viewer**: Unified view of App Details, Docs, Timeline, Inspection Reports.
- **Action Center**: Approve, Reject, Query, Forward.
- **Reports**: Generate PDF reports.

### Enforcement Wing
- **Real-time Monitoring**: IoT/Meter reading integration.
- **Inspection App**: Mobile-friendly view for field officers.
- **Violation Matrix**: Automated mapping of findings to violations.
- **Penalty System**: Calculation and recovery tracking.
